    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωρ-οφθαλμία</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a disease of the eyes,
				excessive dryness attended with itching,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMed.Strassb.
				p.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.766
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.68.5
			</span></i>:— hence <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωρ-οφθαλμιάω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.799
			</span></i>; and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψωρ-όφθαλμος</span></b> ,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i>a sufferer from blepharitis,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				12.798
			</span></i>.</div>
